{"publicId":"9e542bd8-87d6-48ed-a077-4e5282596d52","title":"诺华SMA疗法Zolgensma致9例肿瘤病例引FDA和EMA调查","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-07T21:12:08.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-07T21:12:08.000Z","digest":"诺华确认其SMA基因疗法Zolgensma导致9例治疗相关肿瘤病例，其中2例初步证据指向疗法引发，并引发FDA和EMA监管调查。该疗法2022年获FDA批准用于SMA患者，但早期披露的肿瘤发生率为0.3%（未注明数据截止时间）。最新统计显示已出现9例肿瘤病例，较此前披露的2例新增7例，且新增病例均发生在治疗后6个月内。患者支持组织SMA Europe等机构已向FDA提交公开完整数据的请求，并质疑诺华未及时更新肿瘤发生率数据。目前FDA和EMA尚未确认疗法与肿瘤的因果关系，但已启动调查程序。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T21:20:26.885Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"FDA 启动调查 Novartis Zolgensma 与癌症风险关联","latestReport":{"id":"egdw7spzexyumvp23f9ne52mp"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fg504Wraw4A4","title":"FDA launches investigation of Novartis’ Zolgensma after canc","firstReportAt":"2026-11-07T21:12:08.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"egdw7spzexyumvp23f9ne52mp","title":"FDA 启动调查 Novartis Zolgensma 与癌症风险关联","summary":"FDA 正调查 Novartis 的脊髓性肌肉萎缩症基因疗法 Zolgensma 与严重癌症风险的关联。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T21:12:08.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"egdw7spzexyumvp23f9ne52mp","title":"FDA 启动调查 Novartis Zolgensma 与癌症风险关联","summary":"FDA 正调查 Novartis 的脊髓性肌肉萎缩症基因疗法 Zolgensma 与严重癌症风险的关联。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T21:12:08.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","heat":18.9,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-05T23:00:00.000Z","heat":18.4,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","heat":17.8,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z","heat":17.3,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-06T02:00:00.000Z","heat":16.8,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-06T03:00:00